what was the average
response time, what's

00:35:01.810 --> 00:35:04.120
the traffic by proxy, and
what's the average response

00:35:04.120 --> 00:35:05.060
time by proxy--

00:35:05.060 --> 00:35:07.660
so quick high-level
summary of what's going on.

00:35:07.660 --> 00:35:09.860
I could change the
