00:35:24.070 --> 00:35:25.810
And four are highly active--

00:35:25.810 --> 00:35:29.350
or four are active and
two are highly active.

00:35:29.350 --> 00:35:32.185
This gives us an idea of
who's using the system

00:35:32.185 --> 00:35:34.060
and who's going to be
