00:35:44.660 --> 00:35:46.100
Are they on a mobile device?

00:35:46.100 --> 00:35:48.030
Are they on a desktop?

00:35:48.030 --> 00:35:50.267
Are they running Chrome or
are they running Firefox?

00:35:50.267 --> 00:35:52.850
Maybe there's a few folks that
