00:37:03.550 --> 00:37:05.000
when things happen
in the system,

00:37:05.000 --> 00:37:07.870
we could do that in here.

00:37:07.870 --> 00:37:10.610
This is a whole other topic
that's worth digging into.

00:37:10.610 --> 00:37:14.622
But we're going to cut short
